    "detailed_description": "You'll need to hunt down a shuriken before you can attempt to sink it into your opponents!<br><br>The very catchy chipmusic soundtrack is supplied by Daniel Johansson and consists of a curated selection from his &quot;Skogens Djur&quot; series of Amiga mods created under the name Coma of 3LE. The title theme is composed by fegolhuzz.<br><br>Eat my Shuriken and Die! <strong>only supports local multiplayer</strong>. It therefore requires Xbox or PS4 controllers though up to two players can use the keyboard in a pinch. Using Remote Play Together you can play against friends over the internet by streaming even though the game itself doesn't support online multiplayer.",
    "about_the_game": "You'll need to hunt down a shuriken before you can attempt to sink it into your opponents!<br><br>The very catchy chipmusic soundtrack is supplied by Daniel Johansson and consists of a curated selection from his &quot;Skogens Djur&quot; series of Amiga mods created under the name Coma of 3LE. The title theme is composed by fegolhuzz.<br><br>Eat my Shuriken and Die! <strong>only supports local multiplayer</strong>. It therefore requires Xbox or PS4 controllers though up to two players can use the keyboard in a pinch. Using Remote Play Together you can play against friends over the internet by streaming even though the game itself doesn't support online multiplayer.",
